# Redirects from the pre-Quarto (Hugo) URLs.
#
# Hugo published every page as a directory (/lessons/x/material/); Quarto
# publishes a file (/lessons/x/material.html). Lesson landing pages and the
# top-level sections still resolve natively via index.html, so only the child
# pages need mapping. Keep these as long as old links are in circulation --
# the site is linked from a published JOSE paper and from Canvas.
#
# This file is copied into _site by Quarto (see `resources` in _quarto.yml) so
# that it ships with the deploy regardless of how the site is published.

/lessons/:lesson/material               /lessons/:lesson/material.html               301
/lessons/:lesson/discussion_questions   /lessons/:lesson/discussion_questions.html   301
/lessons/:lesson/instructor_notes       /lessons/:lesson/instructor_notes.html       301
/lessons/:lesson/r_tutorial             /lessons/:lesson/r_tutorial.html             301
/lessons/:lesson/r_tutorial_mvgam       /lessons/:lesson/r_tutorial_mvgam.html       301
/lessons/:lesson/supplemental_code      /lessons/:lesson/supplemental_code.html      301
/about/audience                         /about/audience.html                         301
